Videos, streaming and trailer

Exception: without asking, you may record and stream your play, publish
videos and screenshots of the game and monetize them, for example with ads,
subscriptions or donations. You may also show and share the trailer
unaltered. The music may be heard as it plays in the game and the trailer.
Please name the game and link to where it is published.

Music

The theme music (music/theme.mp3) was made by Magnus Tjerneld with Suno on
a paid plan and is used in the game and trailer under Suno's commercial
license. It may not be copied, redistributed or used outside the game and
the trailer, except as heard in recordings, streams and the trailer under
